1
00:00:58,560 --> 00:00:59,840
This shore or the other...

2
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:03,280
Isn't the other shore just another cage?

3
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:05,159
The present you loathe so much...

4
00:01:05,159 --> 00:01:08,879
is the rebirth you begged for in your past life.

5
00:01:10,200 --> 00:01:11,599
Clinging to a mere physical vessel...

6
00:01:11,959 --> 00:01:15,079
is like blaming a reflection for not being real.

7
00:01:15,760 --> 00:01:16,840
How is the reflection at fault?

8
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:19,599
The fault lies with the viewer,

9
00:01:20,560 --> 00:01:22,000
whose mind has never found peace.

10
00:01:25,359 --> 00:01:28,040
I understand why you're trapped in her body.

11
00:01:28,519 --> 00:01:30,319
Which is why I finally decided...

12
00:01:30,319 --> 00:01:31,599
to help her.

13
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:35,200
Though it will harm my own physical vessel,

14
00:01:36,120 --> 00:01:37,799
saving a life...

15
00:01:38,359 --> 00:01:40,280
is more meritorious than building a seven-story pagoda.

16
00:01:46,239 --> 00:01:47,640
I've already communicated

17
00:01:47,640 --> 00:01:48,959
with the soul inside your body.

18
00:01:49,319 --> 00:01:51,319
I can help you complete this ritual.

19
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:52,680
It's called...

20
00:01:53,560 --> 00:01:54,959
The Nine Steps.

21
00:01:55,239 --> 00:01:57,200
Nine is the ultimate number of reincarnation.

22
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:02,200
Every step of the way,

23
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:04,680
you must walk it yourself.

24
00:02:04,959 --> 00:02:07,760
Each step up is a transformation,

25
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:10,080
a rebirth.

26
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:13,439
It sounds like ascending to heaven,

27
00:02:13,759 --> 00:02:14,879
yet feels more like falling.

28
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:17,120
Because with even a single impure thought,

29
00:02:18,280 --> 00:02:21,599
your soul will shatter into dust,

30
00:02:21,879 --> 00:02:23,280
and he'll take you over completely.

31
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:27,759
So what should I do?

32
00:02:28,919 --> 00:02:30,400
First, I need you to find an object

33
00:02:30,400 --> 00:02:33,000
with the strongest resonance to this world.

34
00:02:33,360 --> 00:02:35,240
Preferably an intimate piece of clothing,

35
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:37,199
an heirloom piece of jewelry,

36
00:02:37,439 --> 00:02:38,879
or perhaps...

37
00:02:38,879 --> 00:02:40,719
an unforgettable photograph.

38
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:42,159
But opening the Quantum Gate

39
00:02:42,159 --> 00:02:43,280
requires far greater energy.

40
00:02:43,280 --> 00:02:45,520
You must prepare 99,000 yuan.

41
00:02:45,520 --> 00:02:47,400
Ninety-nine returning to one is the catalyst.

42
00:02:48,319 --> 00:02:49,400
Once the ritual is complete,

43
00:02:49,719 --> 00:02:52,520
every penny will be returned to you.

44
00:02:55,360 --> 00:02:56,680
The money isn't for me.

45
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:58,639
It's to anchor your mind.

46
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:06,159
Can you really help me?

47
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:08,759
At least we can find out...

48
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:12,360
who planted a Gu in you.

49
00:03:12,759 --> 00:03:13,560
Planted a Gu?

50
00:03:19,199 --> 00:03:20,759
You don't have much time left.

51
00:03:21,360 --> 00:03:22,840
Ten days.

52
00:03:22,840 --> 00:03:25,240
In ten days, this gate will close completely.

53
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,280
Fate brought us together.

54
00:03:33,599 --> 00:03:35,520
I can help you through this tribulation.

55
00:04:48,720 --> 00:04:50,160
What is this place?

56
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:52,959
This was Immortal Ge Hong's alchemy furnace back then.

57
00:04:52,959 --> 00:04:55,439
Later, it became their Daoist altar.

58
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:05,600
Left.

59
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:08,600
Turn left.

60
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:11,279
Turn.

61
00:05:17,560 --> 00:05:19,000
We're still in the same spot.

62
00:05:19,000 --> 00:05:19,439
Turn.

63
00:05:21,800 --> 00:05:23,120
How many times has this been now?

64
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:24,839
Is this a Spirit trap?

65
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:35,120
This isn't a Spirit trap.

66
00:05:35,480 --> 00:05:37,040
His resentment is too strong.

67
00:05:37,199 --> 00:05:38,639
He doesn't want us getting close.

68
00:05:40,720 --> 00:05:41,519
Right.

69
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:53,480
How many times is this now?

70
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:57,560
Drive.

71
00:06:00,920 --> 00:06:01,600
Stop.

72
00:06:02,800 --> 00:06:03,480
Stop.

73
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,680
This is it. Get out.

74
00:06:26,680 --> 00:06:28,439
The vegetation here is strange.

75
00:06:31,639 --> 00:06:32,439
Let's go.

76
00:06:59,680 --> 00:07:01,160
Zhang Xiaomin, isn't this

77
00:07:01,160 --> 00:07:01,959
really strange?

78
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:04,120
This place isn't on the map,

79
00:07:05,279 --> 00:07:07,240
and there's no cemetery shown nearby.

80
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,279
This must be the threshold.

81
00:07:13,759 --> 00:07:14,839
This is...

82
00:07:14,839 --> 00:07:17,120
a rift connecting to another world.

83
00:07:17,319 --> 00:07:18,839
The energy field I mentioned.

84
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:20,040
Get in the car, quick.

85
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:21,879
Don't let the negative energy here hurt you.

86
00:07:21,879 --> 00:07:22,800
I'll absorb it.

87
00:07:24,160 --> 00:07:24,800
Go on.

88
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:25,600
Okay.

89
00:07:43,759 --> 00:07:45,199
According to this agreement,

90
00:07:45,199 --> 00:07:47,560
the target property is valued at 800,000 RMB.

91
00:07:47,759 --> 00:07:49,360
Party A shall, as of the effective date,

92
00:07:49,360 --> 00:07:50,240
within the specified time limit,

93
00:07:50,240 --> 00:07:51,879
make a lump-sum payment to Party B

94
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,600
totaling 280,000 RMB.

95
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:55,800
This payment includes Party B's

96
00:07:55,800 --> 00:07:56,959
share of the property,

97
00:07:56,959 --> 00:07:58,439
corresponding to the buyout amount

98
00:07:58,439 --> 00:07:59,800
of 200,000 RMB,

99
00:08:00,079 --> 00:08:01,439
which is, uh,

100
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:03,240
one-fourth of the total value,

101
00:08:03,519 --> 00:08:05,720
and under Article 5 of this agreement,

102
00:08:05,959 --> 00:08:08,519
extra compensation of 80,000 RMB,

103
00:08:08,519 --> 00:08:10,360
which is 10% of the total value.

104
00:08:10,879 --> 00:08:12,879
If you're fine with it, go ahead and sign.

105
00:08:24,560 --> 00:08:25,240
Who is it?

106
00:08:25,560 --> 00:08:26,560
It's me, Sis.

107
00:08:30,759 --> 00:08:31,240
Nana!

108
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:32,399
Come on in, hurry.

109
00:08:34,159 --> 00:08:35,080
What's all this?

110
00:08:35,399 --> 00:08:36,919
Did you really give them the house?

111
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,600
And the money?

112
00:08:40,799 --> 00:08:41,960
280,000 in cash.

113
00:08:42,279 --> 00:08:43,240
Got every penny.

114
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,320
That's more like it.

115
00:08:48,679 --> 00:08:49,480
Sis...

116
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:51,879
Is it okay if I stay with you?

117
00:08:51,879 --> 00:08:53,919
If it's inconvenient, I can rent a place nearby.

118
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,240
Of course it's okay!

119
00:08:55,480 --> 00:08:56,799
How could my place not be okay?

120
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:05,919
Your brother-in-law went down south for business,

121
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,279
and Xiaofan boards at school.

122
00:09:07,279 --> 00:09:08,399
You can stay in his room.

123
00:09:09,360 --> 00:09:11,480
How did that master's ritual go?

124
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:12,120
Did it go smoothly?

125
00:09:13,559 --> 00:09:14,600
I can't really tell.

126
00:09:14,919 --> 00:09:16,080
There's another session this afternoon.

127
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,879
Let me tell you,

128
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,399
faith brings results.

129
00:09:20,080 --> 00:09:21,799
I heard that master is amazing.

130
00:09:21,919 --> 00:09:23,039
He asked so much about you,

131
00:09:23,039 --> 00:09:24,240
and seemed really attentive.

132
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:25,759
What did he ask?

133
00:09:25,919 --> 00:09:26,759
Well...

134
00:09:27,639 --> 00:09:29,279
all those memories from your dreams.

135
00:09:29,320 --> 00:09:30,519
I told him everything.

136
00:09:32,120 --> 00:09:33,720
No wonder he knew everything.

137
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,679
This afternoon,

138
00:09:36,840 --> 00:09:37,799
go a bit earlier.

139
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:42,320
Sis...

140
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,240
In this life,

141
00:09:45,240 --> 00:09:46,679
you're the only one who's truly good to me.

142
00:09:47,559 --> 00:09:48,960
If anything happens to me,

143
00:09:49,600 --> 00:09:51,120
you keep this money.

144
00:09:53,480 --> 00:09:54,399
Stop talking nonsense!

145
00:09:56,320 --> 00:09:57,879
You have to cooperate with the treatment.

146
00:09:58,159 --> 00:10:00,720
This money is your dowry to remarry.

147
00:10:01,679 --> 00:10:02,320
Hear me?

148
00:10:03,120 --> 00:10:04,519
You're still so young.

149
00:10:04,639 --> 00:10:06,039
Don't let your thoughts run wild.

150
00:10:06,799 --> 00:10:07,519
You can't stay a widow forever.

151
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,440
A husband-jinx like me...

152
00:10:10,919 --> 00:10:11,879
Who would even want me?

153
00:10:13,159 --> 00:10:14,080
Nonsense again!

154
00:10:18,360 --> 00:10:19,320
As for that matter,

155
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:21,559
honestly, I don't understand it either.

156
00:10:22,519 --> 00:10:24,200
Still, regarding your money,

157
00:10:24,320 --> 00:10:25,120
leave it with me,

158
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:25,919
and don't worry.

159
00:10:26,039 --> 00:10:27,200
I'll deposit it for you.

160
00:10:31,279 --> 00:10:32,879
Take good care of yourself, hear me?

161
00:10:44,600 --> 00:10:46,919
I've channeled half the energy into you.

162
00:10:47,879 --> 00:10:49,159
As for the other half,

163
00:10:49,639 --> 00:10:50,639
I need to use my inner power

164
00:10:50,639 --> 00:10:53,000
to purge all the negative energy inside,

165
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,639
before channeling it to you.

166
00:10:58,240 --> 00:10:59,799
The memories of Fu Ting in my dreams...

167
00:10:59,879 --> 00:11:01,279
Did my sister tell you about them?

168
00:11:01,919 --> 00:11:02,720
I asked her.

169
00:11:03,480 --> 00:11:04,360
Know yourself and know your enemy,

170
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,600
and you'll never lose a battle.

171
00:11:07,200 --> 00:11:08,639
Once we send him away,

172
00:11:08,679 --> 00:11:10,399
how can those memories be erased?

173
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:13,240
回忆在你自己脑子里

174
00:11:13,799 --> 00:11:15,120
If you want to erase them,

175
00:11:16,240 --> 00:11:17,799
it depends on your own faith.

176
00:11:19,879 --> 00:11:20,679
Faith?

177
00:11:22,080 --> 00:11:25,120
Seems someone's faith is in crisis.

178
00:11:25,120 --> 00:11:26,080
Speak your mind.

179
00:11:28,799 --> 00:11:30,480
I was wondering...

180
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:33,039
Was that 99,000 used to make a fake tombstone?

181
00:11:34,399 --> 00:11:35,559
In my memories,

182
00:11:35,559 --> 00:11:37,039
even if Zhang Xiaomin's brother

183
00:11:37,039 --> 00:11:38,559
could afford a tombstone for his mom,

184
00:11:38,600 --> 00:11:39,919
he wouldn't care enough to do it,

185
00:11:40,000 --> 00:11:42,080
let alone carve the murderer's name on it.

186
00:11:48,399 --> 00:11:50,080
I've had this ready for you all along.

187
00:11:50,759 --> 00:11:52,159
I knew this day would come,

188
00:11:52,159 --> 00:11:54,159
so I haven't even opened the money.

189
00:11:54,159 --> 00:11:55,879
Check and see if it's the cash you brought.

190
00:11:57,519 --> 00:11:59,480
To put people's minds at ease,

191
00:11:59,759 --> 00:12:01,799
you have to make them spend some money.

192
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,080
If they don't bleed a little,

193
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:05,039
they won't believe you're the real deal.

194
00:12:06,440 --> 00:12:08,399
From the day I first met you,

195
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:11,200
I knew you'd give up halfway.

196
00:12:11,240 --> 00:12:13,399
That's why from the start,

197
00:12:13,399 --> 00:12:14,639
I never planned to take this on.

198
00:12:18,399 --> 00:12:20,799
Wh-What do you mean?

199
00:12:20,879 --> 00:12:22,440
Caring about money

200
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:25,480
proves you're still bound to this mortal world.

201
00:12:26,360 --> 00:12:28,000
To take the final step,

202
00:12:28,240 --> 00:12:30,799
we need a place cut off from the world.

203
00:12:30,960 --> 00:12:32,240
Untouched by mortals,

204
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,320
stripped of human desires,

205
00:12:33,440 --> 00:12:34,600
carrying no money,

206
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:35,720
holding no attachments.

207
00:12:37,840 --> 00:12:38,639
Of course,

208
00:12:39,679 --> 00:12:40,519
whether to do it or not,

209
00:12:40,519 --> 00:12:42,679
I still respect your decision.

210
00:12:44,279 --> 00:12:45,679
But you must know,

211
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,120
today is the final day.

212
00:12:48,399 --> 00:12:50,360
It's the only chance

213
00:12:50,360 --> 00:12:52,840
to connect with his world.

214
00:12:54,000 --> 00:12:55,679
If you back out now,

215
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:59,200
while I'd find it a shame,

216
00:12:59,519 --> 00:13:01,440
at least I won't have to risk my life with you.

217
00:13:01,799 --> 00:13:02,879
Take your money.

218
00:13:02,879 --> 00:13:05,559
This stuff has nothing to do with the ritual.

219
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,440
It's merely a leash

220
00:13:07,480 --> 00:13:09,480
used to rein in ordinary folks.

221
00:13:09,519 --> 00:13:11,600
What use do immortals have for money?

222
00:13:15,120 --> 00:13:16,519
I respect your choice.

223
00:13:16,519 --> 00:13:18,320
Deep down, though, you know

224
00:13:20,399 --> 00:13:21,559
once you give up...

225
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:26,720
Once you give up,

226
00:13:27,960 --> 00:13:29,320
the road ahead is hopeless,

227
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:32,080
and the one trapped in bloodshed

228
00:13:34,399 --> 00:13:35,080
will be you alone.

229
00:13:57,159 --> 00:13:58,000
Come with me.

230
00:15:17,559 --> 00:15:20,120
Your dreams are all about murder.

231
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:23,240
This place was built in the 1930s

232
00:15:23,639 --> 00:15:24,879
specifically to fend off

233
00:15:24,879 --> 00:15:27,120
murderous, plundering bandits.

234
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:28,200
So

235
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:32,039
it matches your energy field perfectly.

236
00:15:38,919 --> 00:15:40,360
For this final step,

237
00:15:42,039 --> 00:15:43,279
there can be no outsiders,

238
00:15:44,519 --> 00:15:45,759
no external tools,

239
00:15:46,799 --> 00:15:49,440
and it must be finished before midnight.

240
00:15:50,120 --> 00:15:51,200
Once midnight passes,

241
00:15:51,720 --> 00:15:53,039
all is lost.

242
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,159
The field is calibrated.

243
00:16:10,639 --> 00:16:11,679
The realm is stabilized.

244
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:13,960
Consciousness is a particle,

245
00:16:14,559 --> 00:16:15,639
and a wave frequency.

246
00:16:18,679 --> 00:16:19,639
Superimposing universes,

247
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:21,120
interfering with destiny.

248
00:16:23,919 --> 00:16:25,000
Entangling fate,

249
00:16:28,159 --> 00:16:29,679
dispersing your probability cloud.

250
00:16:32,960 --> 00:16:34,480
I'm so dizzy...

251
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:43,080
If I can truly break free from this

252
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:45,919
and return to reality...

253
00:17:05,839 --> 00:17:07,319
These clothes are worldly trappings.

254
00:17:09,880 --> 00:17:11,119
Clinging to them is futile.

255
00:17:14,799 --> 00:17:16,960
Let me help you shed these worldly trappings.

256
00:17:41,359 --> 00:17:43,240
Heaven and earth see true devotion,

257
00:17:44,039 --> 00:17:45,480
not this mortal flesh.

258
00:17:47,440 --> 00:17:50,079
Shedding your clothes casts off attachment.

259
00:17:51,559 --> 00:17:54,759
Only shedding the shell reveals the true self.

260
00:17:56,279 --> 00:17:57,680
To harmonize yin and yang,

261
00:17:59,039 --> 00:18:00,519
you must cleanse the three taints.

262
00:18:01,920 --> 00:18:03,319
Renounce all worldly desires,

263
00:18:05,319 --> 00:18:06,720
only then can you commune with the universe.
